# Component conventions

Applies to every UI surface (side panel, popup, options, pages).

**Names.** Two or three PascalCase words (`PanelBody`, `CatalogCard`). Four only if shorter is unclear. Exception: `App`. Folder name matches the component.

**No ARIA.** Do not add `aria-*` or `role`. Keep `type="button"` and `disabled`.

**SCSS.** One root class per module. Nest selectors to follow the JSX tree. Do not flatten siblings of one block. Do not nest past the DOM. Pseudo-classes stay on the element they modify.

```scss
.root {
  .head {
    .name {
    }
    .ico {
      &:disabled {
      }
    }
  }
}
```
